Description: Wild OS Mail
 Email for Wild OS on evolution-data-server's mail engine: IMAP and SMTP
 accounts kept on the PC for offline reading, messages drawn without
 scripts and with web pictures blocked until asked for, trackers blocked
 even then, and photo locations removed from attachments.
 .
 Also Wild OS Calendar, on evolution-data-server's calendar service: day,
 week and month views, Google, iCloud, CalDAV and web calendars,
 invitations answered from Mail, and reminders as notifications.
 .
 People and Tasks sit beside them in the same window: contacts and task
 lists kept on the PC and synced with the same Google, iCloud and CardDAV
 or CalDAV accounts.
